Package: fz-m1-touch-mode
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: MichaelH1981 <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, pkexec, systemd, udev
Homepage: https://github.com/MichaelH1981/fz-m1-touch-mode
Description: Panasonic FZ-M1 MK3 touch and passive stylus mode control
 Safely selects the Touch, Pen, Pen/Touch, Glove, and Water profiles of the
 Sharp 04dd:9762 controller. Includes dynamic udev/systemd activation and a
 password-free, narrowly scoped Plasma/XFCE tray widget using Polkit.
